Program 4: Function to find the square of a number
public class Square {

    int findSquare(int number) {
        return number * number;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        Square obj = new Square();

        int square = obj.findSquare(5);

        System.out.println("Square = " + square);
    }
}
Output
Square = 25
Explanation
•	The method receives a number as input.
•	It multiplies the number by itself.
•	The result is returned to the main method.
